{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "lms-fawry-collection",
		"name": "LMS - Fawry (Ahmed Kamel)",
		"description": "Postman collection for the Fawry LMS microservices project.\n\nAll requests go through the API Gateway on port 8080.\n\n**Test Flow:**\n1. Register an Instructor → Register a Student\n2. Login as Instructor → Create courses\n3. Login as Student → Enroll in courses\n4. View profiles, courses, enrollments\n\n**Auto-token:** Login/Register requests automatically save the JWT token to the `token` collection variable.",
